      }
    },
    "Test Adapter (Dev)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试适配器（开发）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在测试…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Python API allows scripts you run to control iTerm2 and access all its data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Python API 允许你运行的脚本控制 iTerm2 并访问其所有数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Python environment for “%@” is missing (the shared runtime may have been deleted). Rebuild it from its saved requirements now?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”的 Python 环境缺失（共享运行时可能已被删除）。立即从其存储的依赖中重建？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download “%@” is larger than %@. Continue?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载“%@”大于 %@。继续？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file at “%@” could not be quarantined or deleted! It is dangerous and should be removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”处的文件无法隔离或删除！它很危险，应被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder “%@” contains no images, so no background image will be shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹“%@”不包含图像，因此不会显示背景图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder “%@” could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹“%@”无法读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder “%@” could not be used because it does not exist or is not a directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹“%@”无法使用，因为它不存在或不是目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The global keyboard shortcut you have set is overridden by at least one profile. Check your profiles’ keyboard settings if it doesn't work as expected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你设置的全局键盘快捷键被至少一个配置文件覆盖。如果它没有按预期工作，请检查配置文件的键盘设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image “%@” could not be loaded because it is corrupt or not a supported format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像“%@”无法载入，因为它已损坏或不是受支持的格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image “%@” could not be loaded because the file is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像“%@”无法载入，因为文件为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keyboard shortcut you have set for this profile will take precedence over an existing shortcut for the same key combination in a global shortcut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你为此配置文件设置的键盘快捷键将优先于全局快捷键中的同一按键组合的现有快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The location of your Application Support directory appears to have moved or its contents have changed unexpectedly. As a precaution, the authentication mechanism for Python API scripts for iTerm2 has been reverted to always require Automation permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Application Support 目录位置似乎已移动或其内容发生意外更改。为以防万一，iTerm2 的 Python API 脚本认证机制已恢复为始终要求“自动化”权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is fixed after the chat starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聊天开始后模型将固定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording could not be loaded. It might be corrupted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录制无法载入。它可能已损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The setting could not be changed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法更改设置：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shared Python runtime is Intel-only and cannot run on this version of macOS. Download the Apple Silicon version now?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享 Python 运行时仅支持 Intel，无法在此版本的 macOS 上运行。立即下载 Apple Silicon 版本？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's a lot of printing going on. Want to keep allowing it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在大量打印。要继续允许吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These profiles are dynamic and not marked ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些配置文件是动态的，且未标记 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This instance of iTerm2 is already attached to this session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 iTerm2 实例已附加到此会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the last nightly build that will support macOS 11 and older. Sorry for the inconvenience!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是支持 macOS 11 及更早版本的最后一个 nightly 构建。造成不便，敬请谅解！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This nightly build is over 30 days old. Consider updating soon: you may be suffering from awful bugs in blissful ignorance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 nightly 构建已超过 30 天。建议尽快更新：你可能在不知不觉中深受严重 bug 之苦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This preset does not have separate colors for light mode and dark mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预设没有为浅色模式和深色模式提供独立的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This preset has colors for both light mode and dark mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预设同时包含浅色模式和深色模式的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording could not be loaded because it is missing critical information.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此录制无法载入，因为它缺少关键信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording is from a newer version of iTerm2 and cannot be replayed in this version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此录制来自较新版本的 iTerm2，无法在此版本中回放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the cc-status hook from ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将从以下位置移除 cc-status 钩子："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will erase iTerm2’s configuration settings for this password manager. The actual passwords will remain unaffected. You’ll have to go through some setup steps to use it again. This action cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将清除 iTerm2 对此密码管理器的配置设置。实际密码不受影响。要再次使用它，你需要重新完成一些设置步骤。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will move the script into the AutoLaunch folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会将脚本移入 AutoLaunch 文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timeout": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To have a new window open in a specific space, make sure that Spaces is enabled in System Preferences and that it is configured to switch directly to a space with ^ Number Keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
