            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 已迁移到新中继。为了让你的 Mac 和 iPhone 保持连接，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 no longer warns before a multi-line paste, unless you are at the shell prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
