            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ Secure keyboard entry disables paste history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠️ 安全键盘输入会停用粘贴历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "😞 Your shell is not supported, or perhaps your $SHELL environment variable is not set correctly. Press “Continue” to try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "😞 你的 Shell 不受支持，或者 $SHELL 环境变量可能未正确设置。按“继续”重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2’s cc-status hook is no longer in ~/.claude/settings.json. This usually means Claude Code rewrote that file. Reinstall the hook so per-tab status indicators (“Working…,” “Waiting…”) work again?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 的 cc-status 钩子已不在 ~/.claude/settings.json 中。这通常意味着 Claude Code 重写了该文件。重新安装钩子，以便每个标签页的状态指示器（“正在处理…”、“正在等待…”）重新工作？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t Remove Hooks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除钩子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer enabled iTerm2’s ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装程序已启用 iTerm2 的 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the profiles you’ll run claude in. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择你要在其中运行 claude 的配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was a problem saving snippets to “%@”.\n\nThe error was:\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将代码片段存储到“%@”时出现问题。\\n\\n错误为：\\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smart Selection Playground\nEnter text here, then click to see which rule matches at that location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能选择演练场\\n在此输入文本，然后点按查看该位置匹配的规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you activate Semantic History on a text file, the specified editor opens it.\nOther kinds of files will be opened with their default apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你在文本文件上启用语义历史记录时，指定的编辑器会打开它。\\n其他类型的文件将用默认应用打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can use captured strings from the Smart Selection's regular expression in the parameter. Use \\0 for match, \\1…\\9 for match groups, \\d for directory, \\u for user, \\h for host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以在参数中使用智能选择正则表达式捕获的字符串。使用 \\\\0 表示匹配项，\\\\1…\\\\9 表示匹配组，\\\\d 表示目录，\\\\u 表示用户，\\\\h 表示主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key-binding action Copy Interpolated String “%@” failed:\n\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按键绑定操作“拷贝内插字符串”“%@”失败：\\n\\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looks like the selection changed and is no longer a valid JSON object.\nYou can find this feature under Edit > Replace Selection > Replace with Pretty-Printed JSON if you want to try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选内容似乎已更改，不再是有效的 JSON 对象。\\n如果你想重试，可以在“编辑 > 替换所选内容 > 替换为格式化 JSON”下找到此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you want to allow all apps running on this machine to use the Python API?\n\nThis will disable the check for Automation permission. If you agree, you’ll be prompted for administrator access to make the change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要允许此机器上运行的所有应用使用 Python API 吗？\\n\\n这将停用对“自动化”权限的检查。如果你同意，系统将提示你提供管理员访问权限以进行更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed to remove the file “%@”: %@\n\nPlease remove this file manually to require Automation permission for the Python API.\n\nThe Python API has been disabled for your security.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除文件“%@”失败：%@\\n\\n请手动移除此文件，以便为 Python API 要求“自动化”权限。\\n\\n为安全起见，Python API 已停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is taking a long time to locate all scripts under %@. Avoid storing many files or using network mounts for the scripts folder.\n\nContinue?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定位 %@ 下的所有脚本耗时较长。避免在脚本文件夹中存储大量文件或使用网络挂载。\\n\\n继续？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Image Selected — Click to set": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未选择图像 — 点按设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was a problem finding or creating your application support directory. iTerm2 won't work very well until this problem is fixed.\n\nIt should be at ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nThe error was:\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找或创建应用支持目录时出现问题。在此问题修复前，iTerm2 将无法正常工作。\\n\\n它应位于 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2。\\n\\n错误为：\\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was a problem finding or creating the config directory. You can set “Settings > Advanced > Folder for config files“ to set a custom location for this directory. Until this is fixed, some features will be disabled.\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找或创建配置目录时出现问题。你可以设置“设置 > 高级 > 配置文件文件夹”为此目录指定自定义位置。在此问题修复前，某些功能将被停用。\\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure keyboard entry is enabled.\n\nIn macOS 12 and later, enabling Secure Keyboard Entry prevents other programs from being activated. This affects the `open` command as well as the panel shown when using Touch ID for sudo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用安全键盘输入。\\n\\n在 macOS 12 及更高版本中，启用安全键盘输入会阻止其他程序被激活。这会影响 `open` 命令以及使用 Touch ID 进行 sudo 时显示的面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication failed because %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "认证失败，因为 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The LastPass service took too long to respond. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LastPass 服务响应超时。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also try opening a terminal window and running `lpass login %@`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你也可以尝试打开终端窗口并运行 `lpass login %@`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The existing installation of the OnePassword CLI at %@ is an incompatible. The iTerm2 integration requires version 2.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 处已安装的 1Password CLI 不兼容。iTerm2 集成需要版本 2。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version 2 of the OnePassword CLI could not be found. Check that %@ is installed and has version 2.x.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到 1Password CLI 版本 2。请检查 %@ 已安装且为 2.x 版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
