            "value": "当前会话是 tmux 会话。你希望创建新的 tmux %@，还是使用默认配置文件？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system Python's iterm2 module is out of date and won't work with this version of iTerm2. Run `%@` to fix it.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统 Python 的 iterm2 模块已过时，将无法与此版本的 iTerm2 配合使用。请运行 `%@` 进行修复。"
          }
