          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP 请求失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load settings from URL? Some changes were made to the local copy that will be lost.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 URL 载入设置？本地副本中的某些更改将丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error Loading Settings": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "载入设置时出错"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have enabled “Load settings from a custom folder or URL” in settings but the location is not set.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已在设置中启用“从自定义文件夹或 URL 载入设置”，但尚未设置位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed to load settings from custom directory. Falling back to local copy.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从自定义目录载入设置失败。将回退到本地副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missing or malformed file at \"%@\"": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%@\" 处的文件缺失或格式错误"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings cannot be copied to a URL.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置无法拷贝到 URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To make it available, first quit iTerm2 and then manually copy ~/Library/Preferences/com.googlecode.iterm2.plist to your hosting provider.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要使其可用，请先退出 iTerm2，然后手动将 ~/Library/Preferences/com.googlecode.iterm2.plist 拷贝到你的托管服务提供商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed to copy settings to custom directory.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将设置拷贝到自定义目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tried to copy %@ to %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试将 %@ 拷贝到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can also keep your snippets, global notes, and session icon customizations in the settings folder “%@” so they sync across machines. Notes and snippets can contain sensitive text such as passwords or tokens. Sync them too?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 还可以将你的代码片段、全局笔记和会话图标自定义项保存在设置文件夹“%@”中，以便在机器之间同步。笔记和代码片段可能包含密码或令牌等敏感文本。也同步它们？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snippets, notes, or icon customizations changed both on this Mac and in the settings folder “%@” since they were last in sync. Which copy would you like to keep?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自上次同步以来，代码片段、笔记或图标自定义项在这台 Mac 和设置文件夹“%@”中都发生了更改。你想保留哪个副本？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings and your snippets, notes, or icon customizations have changed. Copy them to %@?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置以及你的代码片段、笔记或图标自定义项已更改。将其拷贝到 %@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings have changed. Copy them to %@?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置已更改。将其拷贝到 %@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your snippets, notes, or icon customizations changed. Copy them to %@?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的代码片段、笔记或图标自定义项已更改。将其拷贝到 %@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lose Changes": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放弃更改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can provide substitutions as follows:\n  \\1 will be replaced with the filename.\n  \\2 will be replaced with the line number.\n  \\3 will be replaced with the text before the click.\n  \\4 will be replaced with the text after the click.\n  \\5 will be replaced with the working directory.\n\nThis is also an interpolated string evaluated in the context of the current session. In addition to the usual variables, the following substitutions are available:\n  \\(semanticHistory.path) will be replaced with the filename.\n  \\(semanticHistory.lineNumber) will be replaced with the line number.\n  \\(semanticHistory.columnNumber) will be replaced with the column number.\n  \\(semanticHistory.prefix) will be replaced with the text before the click.\n  \\(semanticHistory.suffix) will be replaced with the text after the click.\n  \\(semanticHistory.workingDirectory) will be replaced with the working directory.\n": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以按以下方式提供替换项：\n  \\1 将替换为文件名。\n  \\2 将替换为行号。\n  \\3 将替换为点按前的文本。\n  \\4 将替换为点按后的文本。\n  \\5 将替换为工作目录。\n\n这也是在当前会话上下文中求值的内插字符串。除常用变量外，还可以使用以下替换项：\n  \\(semanticHistory.path) 将替换为文件名。\n  \\(semanticHistory.lineNumber) 将替换为行号。\n  \\(semanticHistory.columnNumber) 将替换为列号。\n  \\(semanticHistory.prefix) 将替换为点按前的文本。\n  \\(semanticHistory.suffix) 将替换为点按后的文本。\n  \\(semanticHistory.workingDirectory) 将替换为工作目录。\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In this mode semantic history will be activated on any click, even if you click on something that is not an existing file.\n%@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在此模式下，即使你点按的不是现有文件，语义历史记录也会在任意点按时激活。\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In this mode semantic history will only be activated when you click on an existing file name.\n%@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在此模式下，仅当你点按现有文件名时，语义历史记录才会激活。\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you activate Semantic History on a filename, the browser opens a URL.\nUse \\1 for the filename you clicked on and \\2 for the line number. ": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在文件名上激活语义历史记录时，浏览器会打开一个 URL。\n使用 \\1 表示你点按的文件名，\\2 表示行号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command runs when you activate Semantic History on any filename. Use \\1 for filename, \\2 for line number, \\3 for text before click, \\4 for text after click, \\5 for pwd. You can also use interpolated string syntax. ": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何文件名上激活语义历史记录时运行命令。使用 \\1 表示文件名，\\2 表示行号，\\3 表示点按前的文本，\\4 表示点按后的文本，\\5 表示当前目录。你也可以使用内插字符串语法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command runs when you activate Semantic History on any text, even if it’s not a valid filename. Use \\1 for filename, \\2 for line number, \\3 for text before click, \\4 for text after click, \\5 for pwd. ": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何文本上激活语义历史记录时运行命令，即使它不是有效的文件名。使用 \\1 表示文件名，\\2 表示行号，\\3 表示点按前的文本，\\4 表示点按后的文本，\\5 表示当前目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coprocess runs when you activate Semantic History on any filename. Use \\1 for filename, \\2 for line number, \\3 for text before click, \\4 for text after click, \\5 for pwd. ": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何文件名上激活语义历史记录时运行协同进程。使用 \\1 表示文件名，\\2 表示行号，\\3 表示点按前的文本，\\4 表示点按后的文本，\\5 表示当前目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text is sent when you activate Semantic History on any filename. Use vim-style special characters.Use \\1 for filename, \\2 for line number, \\3 for text before click, \\4 for text after click, \\5 for pwd. ": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何文件名上激活语义历史记录时发送文本。使用 vim 风格的特殊字符。使用 \\1 表示文件名，\\2 表示行号，\\3 表示点按前的文本，\\4 表示点按后的文本，\\5 表示当前目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
