          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase Paste History": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抹掉粘贴历史记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste history will be erased. Continue?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将抹掉粘贴历史记录。是否继续？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running git in %@ didn’t finish within %@ seconds, so the status bar component can’t show the branch. This often happens in very large repositories or when the working tree is on a slow filesystem.\n\nWould you like to increase the timeout to %@ seconds?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 中运行的 git 未在 %@ 秒内完成，因此状态栏组件无法显示分支。这常见于非常大的代码库，或工作树位于较慢文件系统上的情况。\n\n是否要将超时时间增加到 %@ 秒？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the current directory": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Increase to %@s": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增加到 %@ 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debug Logging Enabled": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用调试日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please reproduce the bug. Then toggle debug logging again to save the log.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请复现该问题，然后再次切换调试日志以保存日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debug Logging Stopped": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调试日志已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please send /tmp/debuglog.txt to the developers.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请将 /tmp/debuglog.txt 发送给开发者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can keep its built-in list of AI models current by periodically downloading a cryptographically signed list from iterm2.com. No terminal content or personal data is sent. Allow this?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 可以定期从 iterm2.com 下载经过加密签名的列表，以保持内置 AI 模型列表的最新状态。不会发送任何终端内容或个人数据。允许吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can include this session’s visible screen and terminal state with every message you send in AI chats where you’ve allowed it, so the assistant sees what you see. You can turn this off any time from a chat’s permission settings.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 可以在你允许的 AI 聊天中，将每条消息附带该会话的可见屏幕和终端状态，以便助手看到你所看到的内容。你可以随时在聊天的权限设置中关闭此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All terminal content will be sent to AI, which may go to a third party. Ensure this is safe to do before proceeding.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有终端内容都会发送给 AI，可能会发送给第三方。继续前请确保这样做是安全的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orchestration mode lets the agent coordinate across any iTerm2 sessions. It can read screen contents from any session, but to type into a session requires your permission. This is a more permissive model than when an agent is linked to a single session, where there are very fine-grained permission settings.\n\nEnabling will detach any linked terminal or browser session and switch the chat to Orchestration mode.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编排模式可让智能体跨任意 iTerm2 会话进行协调。它可以读取任何会话的屏幕内容，但要向会话中输入文字则需要你的许可。这种模式比智能体关联到单个会话时更加宽松，后者具有非常细粒度的权限设置。\n\n启用后将取消关联任何已链接的终端或浏览器会话，并将聊天切换到编排模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Chat could not open because of a problem loading the database. Verify there is only one instance of iTerm2 running.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 聊天无法打开，因为加载数据库时出现问题。请确认只有一个 iTerm2 实例在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chat could not be renamed.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聊天无法重命名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can use AI to check the safety of commands suggested by your AI agent. Would you like to enable safety checking?\n\nWhen enabled, each proposed command will be sent to your configured AI provider for a safety check.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 可以使用 AI 检查你的 AI 智能体建议的命令是否安全。要启用安全检查吗？\n\n启用后，每条建议的命令都将发送给你配置的 AI 提供商进行安全检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until now, iTerm2 checked the safety of AI-suggested commands on your Mac using Apple Intelligence, at no cost. It can now use your configured AI model instead, which is more accurate but sends each checked command to your AI provider and may incur charges.\n\nSwitch to your configured model? If you decline, iTerm2 keeps using Apple Intelligence.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到目前为止，iTerm2 一直在你的 Mac 上使用 Apple Intelligence 免费检查 AI 建议命令的安全性。现在它可以改用你配置的 AI 模型，准确度更高，但会将每条被检查的命令发送给你的 AI 提供商，并可能产生费用。\n\n要切换到你的模型吗？如果你拒绝，iTerm2 将继续使用 Apple Intelligence。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Generative AI features have been disabled. Check with your system administrator.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成式 AI 功能已被禁用。请联系你的系统管理员。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must install the AI plugin before you can use this feature.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此功能前，你必须先安装 AI 插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must enable AI features in settings before you can use this feature.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此功能前，你必须在设置中启用 AI 功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Would you like to open the profile formerly named %@ that is now called %@ (which this shortcut refers to), or the profile that currently has the name %@?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要打开以前名为 %1$@、现在名为 %2$@（此快捷方式所指向的）的配置文件，还是打开当前名为 %3$@ 的配置文件？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Future versions of iTerm2 will require macOS 13 (Ventura) or later. This is the last version that supports macOS 12. Sorry for the inconvenience!": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未来版本的 iTerm2 将需要 macOS 13（Ventura）或更高版本。这是支持 macOS 12 的最后一个版本。给你带来不便，敬请谅解！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was a problem saving the file: %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存文件时出现问题：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must install the Browser Plugin first. Download it now?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你必须先安装浏览器插件。现在下载吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not create movie: %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法创建影片：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Would you like to create the directory at %@?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要创建位于 %@ 的目录吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed to create %@:\n\n%@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法创建 %@：\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the cc-status hook from ~/.claude/settings.json, the Claude Code workgroup from your settings, and the Enter/Exit Workgroup triggers from every profile. You can reinstall any time using iTerm2 > Install Claude Code Integration.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将从 ~/.claude/settings.json 中移除 cc-status 钩子，从你的设置中移除 Claude Code 工作组，并从每个配置文件中移除“进入/退出工作组”触发器。你可以随时通过“iTerm2 > 安装 Claude Code 集成”重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer enabled iTerm2’s Python API. Other scripts or integrations may be using it now. Leave it enabled, or turn it off?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装程序启用了 iTerm2 的 Python API。其他脚本或集成现在可能正在使用它。保持启用，还是将其关闭？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the profiles you’ll run claude in. We’ll add Enter/Exit Workgroup triggers to each one so the Claude Code workgroup is entered automatically.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择你将在其中运行 claude 的配置文件。我们将为每个配置文件添加“进入/退出工作组”触发器，以便自动进入 Claude Code 工作组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These profiles are dynamic and not marked “rewritable,” so iTerm2 normally regenerates them from disk and any change here would be lost:\n\n%@\n\niTerm2 can write the triggers back to dynamic profiles when they’re marked rewritable. Rewriting can change the order of values in the underlying file.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些配置文件是动态的，且未标记为“可重写”，因此 iTerm2 通常会从磁盘重新生成它们，此处的任何更改都会丢失：\n\n%@\n\niTerm2 可以在配置文件被标记为可重写后，将触发器写回动态配置文件。重写可能会更改底层文件中值的顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will open %@ in %@.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将在 %2$@ 中打开 %1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iTerm2 server has moved to a new address. Your paired iPhone is still registered with the old server. The old server will go away soon. You should re-pair to avoid problems when that happens.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 服务器已迁移到新地址。你的配对 iPhone 仍注册在旧服务器上。旧服务器很快将关闭。为避免出现问题，你应该重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your paired iPhone can’t connect because some pairing information stored on this Mac is missing (%@). This can happen after reinstalling or rebuilding iTerm2, or after a keychain reset. Re-pair to fix it.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的配对 iPhone 无法连接，因为此 Mac 上存储的某些配对信息缺失（%@）。这可能在重新安装或重建 iTerm2 之后，或钥匙串重置之后发生。重新配对即可修复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 has moved to the new relay. For your Mac and iPhone to keep connecting, update the iTerm2 Buddy app on your iPhone to the latest version.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 已迁移到新的中继服务器。为让 Mac 与 iPhone 保持连接，请将 iPhone 上的 iTerm2 Buddy 应用更新到最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily relay data limit reached (reconnecting…)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已达到每日中继数据流量上限（正在重新连接…）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily relay data limit reached (retry in %@)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已达到每日中继数据流量上限（%@ 后重试）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n\nYou can finish setting up in Companion Device Settings.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\n你可以在“Companion 设备设置”中完成设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No ssh connection to %@ is available to upload %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有可用的 ssh 连接（%@）来上传 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK to run:\n%@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认运行：\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK to open this file?\n%@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认打开此文件？\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Chat could not be opened. Verify you only have one instance of iTerm2 running.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 聊天无法打开。请确认你只运行了一个 iTerm2 实例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open file at %@?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要打开位于 %@ 的文件吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open URL %@?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要打开 URL %@ 吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any needed Python runtimes will be installed and secure settings will be updated, which may require you to enter your password. Then iTerm2 will restart and finish importing. This can take several minutes.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何需要的 Python 运行时都将被安装，安全设置将被更新，这可能要求你输入密码。然后 iTerm2 将重新启动并完成导入。这可能需要几分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Would you like to export your settings and data first? You will be able to re-import the exported file later if you change your mind.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是否要先导出你的设置和数据？如果改变主意，稍后可以重新导入导出的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 logged what it would have erased to Console.app. Nothing was actually deleted because the “Dry-run Erase All Settings and Data” advanced setting is enabled.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 已将本应擦除的内容记录到“控制台”应用中。由于“干运行擦除所有设置和数据”高级设置已启用，实际上没有删除任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To install the Nerd Font Bundle iTerm2 must first download and install these fonts: %@.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要安装 Nerd 字体包，iTerm2 必须首先下载并安装以下字体：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will replace existing special exceptions. Continue?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将替换现有的特殊例外。继续吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "### For This Setting\n%@\n\n\n": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "### 本设置\n%@\n\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "### Background\nBinding a setting to an expression lets you change settings programmatically.\n\niTerm2 tracks a collection of “Variables” for each session. You can learn more about them in [Scripting Fundamentals](https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html).\n\nTypically this feature is used by binding a setting to a user-defined variable.\n\n### Example\nThe easiest way to set a user-defined variable is to install shell integration and then define a `iterm2_print_user_vars` function. Here’s an example using bash:\n\n```\niterm2_print_user_vars() {\n  iterm2_set_user_var %@ $(echo $%@)\n}\n```\n\nThis runs each time the shell prompt is printed. The example sets a user-defined variable to the value of the environment variable `%@`.\n\nThe appropriate expression to bind this example would be `user.%@`. All user-defined variables go in the `user` scope.\n\n### Debugging\nYou can view variables in the Inspector (**Scripts > Manage > Console** and then click **Inspector**).": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "### 背景\n将设置绑定到表达式可以让你以编程方式更改设置。\n\niTerm2 会为每个会话跟踪一组“变量”。你可以通过[脚本基础](https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html)了解详情。\n\n通常，此功能用于将设置绑定到用户定义的变量。\n\n### 示例\n设置用户定义变量的最简单方法是安装 shell 集成，然后定义一个 `iterm2_print_user_vars` 函数。以下是使用 bash 的示例：\n\n```\niterm2_print_user_vars() {\n  iterm2_set_user_var %@ $(echo $%@)\n}\n```\n\n每次打印 shell 提示符时都会运行此函数。该示例将用户定义变量设置为环境变量 `%@` 的值。\n\n绑定此示例的合适表达式为 `user.%@`。所有用户定义的变量都位于 `user` 作用域中。\n\n### 调试\n你可以在“检查器”（**脚本 > 管理 > 控制台**，然后点按**检查器**）中查看变量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your codecierge session has been going on for a long time. Are you still using it? If not, stop it to save money and privacy.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 codecierge 会话已持续很长时间。你还在使用它吗？如果没有，请停止它，以节省费用并保护隐私。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This lets an AI completely control your computer. It could delete your files, do something stupid or dangerous, or lead to the downfall of humanity. Proceed with caution.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将让 AI 完全控制你的电脑。它可能会删除你的文件、做出愚蠢或危险的事情，甚至导致人类走向灭亡。请谨慎操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything that happens in your terminal while Codecierge is running will be sent to your AI provider. Don’t send them confidential information!": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codecierge 运行时，你的终端中发生的一切都将发送给你的 AI 提供商。请勿向它们发送机密信息！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Touch ID install script is missing from the iTerm2 application bundle.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 iTerm2 应用包中找不到 Touch ID 安装脚本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@?\nIt will run silently in the background.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@？\n它将在后台静默运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved prompts can be re-loaded from the Prompts pulldown.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的提示可以从“提示”下拉菜单中重新加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘⇧T now restores recently closed tabs (Undo Close). The Show Tabs in Fullscreen shortcut has moved to ⌘⇧U.\n\nWould you like to keep ⌘⇧T as the shortcut for Show Tabs in Fullscreen by adding a key binding?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘⇧T 现在用于恢复最近关闭的标签页（撤销关闭）。“全屏显示标签页”的快捷键已移至 ⌘⇧U。\n\n是否要通过添加按键绑定，将 ⌘⇧T 保留为“全屏显示标签页”的快捷键？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These alerts are being answered automatically because you chose to remember your response. Select one and click Un-suppress to be asked again.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些提醒会被自动应答，因为你选择了记住你的答复。请选择其中一个，然后点按“取消屏蔽”以再次询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no usable GPU found on this machine.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未在此电脑上找到可用的 GPU。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPU Renderer is disabled in Settings > General.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在“设置 > 通用”中停用 GPU 渲染器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the current session is not a terminal.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前会话不是终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ligatures are enabled. You can disable them in Settings > Profiles > Text > Use ligatures.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用连字。你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 文本 > 使用连字”中将其停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the GPU renderer is initializing. It should be ready soon.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPU 渲染器正在初始化，应该很快就可以就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the session is too large or too small.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话太大或太小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the session is initializing.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话正在初始化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "transparent windows are not supported. They can be disabled in Settings > Profiles > Window > Transparency.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持透明窗口。你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 窗口 > 透明度”中将其停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the font's vertical spacing set to less than 100%. You can change it in Settings > Profiles > Text > Change Font.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字体垂直间距设置为小于 100%。你可以在“设置 > 配置文件 > 文本 > 更改字体”中更改此设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "terminal window margins are too small. You can edit them in Settings > Advanced.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端窗口边距太小。你可以在“设置 > 高级”中进行编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "annotations or URL shortcuts are open.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有注释或 URL 快捷键处于打开状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this session has natively rendered items.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此会话包含原生渲染的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the find panel is open.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找面板处于打开状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the paste progress indicator is open.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴进度指示器处于打开状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "an announcement (yellow bar) is visible.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有通告（黄色横幅）可见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a URL preview is visible.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 URL 预览可见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the window is being resized.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口正在调整大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the computer is not connected to power. You can enable GPU rendering while disconnected from power in Settings > General > Advanced GPU Settings.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
